# HA custom cards

Independent Lovelace cards in top-level folders (`geyser-control`, `garage-control`, …).
Lit + TypeScript, Vite → single `dist/<name>.js`.

**Read [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) before editing** — source of truth for layout,
non-negotiables, collapsibles, container queries, testing, and deploy.

## Workflow

- Work inside the target card folder; run `npm run dev` / `build` / `typecheck` there
- `npm install` hanging? Stop it, run `npm install -D @mdi/js` instead
- Collapsibles: copy pattern from `geyser-control` or `irrigation-control`
- Deploy: copy `dist/*.js` to HA `www/`, register resource, **bump `?v=`** on the URL

## Easy to forget

- No `getCardSize()` / `getGridOptions()`
- `homeassistant.toggle` / `turn_on` / `turn_off` — not domain-specific services
- Theme via `hass.themes.darkMode` → `data-theme`, not `prefers-color-scheme`
- `--mdc-icon-size` on every sized `ha-icon` rule
- `@container` on `ha-card`; never `container-type` on `:host`
- `entitySignature()` in the `hass` setter
- Dev harness can't reproduce sections-view reflow or real `ha-icon` sizing
